<mxCell id="legend" value="Solid = live in AWS &#183; dashed/grey = designed, not built yet. All S3 locations are &lt;code&gt;cpms/&lt;/code&gt; prefixes in the one project bucket. Only the dispatcher holds OneTrust credentials &#8212; queued receipts carry a placeholder token (design.md &#8594; &quot;Authenticating to OneTrust&quot;). Prod adds an ElastiCache taxonomy cache + VPC (see design.md &#8594; &quot;Development environment&quot;)." style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1540" width="1100" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;OneTrust credentials&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot; face=&quot;Menlo&quot;&gt;cpms-secret-onetrust-cp-emo&lt;br&gt;cpms-kms-onetrust-signing&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;token per collection point &#183; signing key &#183; not built&lt;/i&gt;" tooltip="OneTrust credentials (not built)&#10;cpms-secret-onetrust-cp-&lt;collection point&gt;: the collection point's JWT, read only by the dispatcher — never in SQS, S3, Lambda env vars or the repo.&#10;cpms-kms-onetrust-signing: non-exportable KMS key that signs the optional authorization JWT; its public key is registered in OneTrust, so a leaked token alone can't post receipts." id="creds"><mxCell style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;dashed=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1202" width="240" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
<UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;OneTrust&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;collection point &quot;Vanguard EMO&quot;&lt;br&gt;verifies token + signature&lt;/i&gt;" tooltip="OneTrust — collection point &quot;Vanguard EMO&quot;&#10;API-type collection point: OneTrust's record of where consent was captured, scoped to the purposes that service collects. One per capturing service (e.g. Vanguard EMO, Vanguard CL6).&#10;Verifies the token and signature on each receipt. Configured in OneTrust, not AWS." id="onetrust"><mxCell style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1331" width="240" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
